        "Source passage: 02-information.tex lines 426\u2013452. No OpenAI Lean proof text is copied or adapted; original describes OpenAI proof-text provenance, not absence of local QIC proof reuse.",
        "Native, strict production, all three consumer checks, two exact standard-axiom guards, and two raw axiom reports passed at actual source revision 03c84b6e86a6b0cdf1f0affd25d0738379159bb5. Both historical failed runs are retained without relabeling their revision or result."
